replace('5. **Solidarity surcharge** at 5.5% of the income tax, with the same EUR 20,350 threshold as residents.','5. **Solidarity surcharge.** Establish the assessment base under § 3 SolzG; it is not automatically the unadjusted income-tax amount. For an ordinary single assessment with no § 32d(3) or (4) tax component, it is zero when that base is at most EUR 20,350. Above that threshold, take the smaller of 5.5% of the base and 11.9% of the excess over EUR 20,350, dropping fractions of a cent (§§ 3(3), 4 SolzG). A stipulated base of EUR 20,400 gives min(EUR 1,122, EUR 5.95) = EUR 5.95. The separate § 32d(3)/(4) component and the withholding branches retain their own 5.5% treatment and do not receive this ordinary threshold/cap.','R18')
